                                "sense_id": "e8bfcb24-f9c2-3063-9b5f-9f7e39f6d782",
                                "text": "This wrestler or pahlwan was a devotee of the old type of wrestling, in which the opponent is thrown down and pinned, unable to get out from under the pinner."
